              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji wavika Kafarnaumu, waja wandu wilombagha mchango ghwa Hekalu wikamkotia Petro, “Welee, Mwalimu onyu walipagha mchango ghwa Hekalu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
