            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petro ukawitumbulia, “Ee walipagha.” Nao iji wangia nyumbenyi, Jesu ukazoya kumkotia, “Wele Simoni, keni wazuri wa ndoenyi wadalomba wushuru angu kodi kwa wana wawo angu kwa wandu wazima?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji waghora, “Kwa wandu wazima,” Jesu ukamzera, “Ikakaia ni huwo, basi wana weko huru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela disakewikuwisha; ghenda ndiwenyi, kukumbe kiloo; iji kwawada samaki ya imbiri, na kuitambarua momu ghwake, kuchapata pesa shekeli imweri; nao kuwineke kwa wundu ghwapo na ghwako.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.27"
            ]
